# Everything the bundled worker imports at run time. Exact pins for the
# packages whose behaviour defines the published method; the rest are pinned
# by requirements.lock, which is what the build installs (with hashes).
#
# Regenerate the lock only on purpose, and record why in docs/adr:
#   MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=14.0 uv pip compile requirements.in \
#       --python-platform aarch64-apple-darwin --python-version 3.12 \
#       --generate-hashes --upgrade -o requirements.lock
# Without MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET uv assumes macOS 13 and silently falls
# back to torch 2.11, the last release with macOS 13 wheels.
